      "writtenOn": "2019-02-13T10:35:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I actually think this a defensive copy is a good idea. The copy isn\u0027t really that shallow - most of the members are immutable, and some of them are defensive copies. Looks like that doesn\u0027t hold for mTransportInfo and mNetworkSpecifier. I think those are intended to be immutable but I\u0027m not sure they\u0027re guaranteed to be. But that would be another bug.",
      "parentUuid": "390ca8b1_9979c3c0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 294,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 294,
        "endChar": 18
      },
      "revId": "89277259d12ebb88afd3c48a42d02970da36c8d5",
